=====Synonyms=====
* {{qualifier|punishment}} [[Botany Bay dozen]]

===Etymology 3===
For {{term|testern}}, {{term|teston}}, from {{etyl|fr}} {{term|teston}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|teste}} the head, the head of the king being impressed upon the coin. See {{term|tester}} a covering, and compare {{term|testone}}, {{term|testoon}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# An old [[French]] [[silver]] [[coin]].
# {{UK|slang|dated}} A [[sixpence]].

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|sixpence}} [[teston]], [[tizzy]]

